1
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:22,460
You're awake.

2
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:23,740
Xingcan,

3
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,320
did you sleep well?

4
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,400
What happened last night?

5
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,840
You're too much.

6
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,560
You don't want to take responsibility after drinking?

7
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,460
What?

8
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,590
You deny it when you wake up.

9
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,040
Men are all the same.

10
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:45,880
I'm not.

11
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:46,600
I'm ignoring you.

12
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,500
Xingcan, I...

13
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:43,460
What's wrong?

14
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:45,759
What should I do next?

15
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:47,420
What's my next step?

16
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:50,620
As a lawyer,

17
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:52,020
why are you so panicked?

18
00:01:52,460 --> 00:01:53,979
Spending another second with him

19
00:01:53,979 --> 00:01:54,920
makes me sick.

20
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,000
No.

21
00:01:59,420 --> 00:02:00,660
I need to calm down.

22
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:04,500
I have to sort out everyone's relationships again.

23
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:05,300
Agreed.

24
00:02:05,860 --> 00:02:07,000
You should recall

25
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,729
who you might have overlooked.

26
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:11,000
As this novel says,

27
00:02:11,260 --> 00:02:13,190
the most easily overlooked person

28
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,200
is the instigator of everything.

29
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,760
Baby Mucheng, you are the main character.

30
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:18,020
We are here to see you.

31
00:02:18,020 --> 00:02:19,940
Say something. You were forced, right?

32
00:02:19,940 --> 00:02:20,420
Right?

33
00:02:20,420 --> 00:02:22,060
Baby Mucheng is being bullied by the company.

34
00:02:22,060 --> 00:02:23,960
Now they are bringing in newcomers to siphon her popularity.

35
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:24,490
Let's go.

36
00:02:26,620 --> 00:02:27,380
Where are we going?

37
00:02:27,380 --> 00:02:29,560
Three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

38
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,500
Ready.

39
00:02:31,020 --> 00:02:32,900
We only have a minute and a half this time.

40
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:34,160
Why is it shorter again?

41
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,300
Go and come back quickly.

42
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:36,100
Four, two.

43
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,420
Done.

44
00:02:48,700 --> 00:02:49,560
Go on.

45
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,800
Where's my computer?

46
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,360
Found it.

47
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:08,200
This guy is an old fan of Mucheng,

48
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:11,560
and a blogger commenting on current affairs.

49
00:03:13,460 --> 00:03:14,260
Hold this.

50
00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:20,100
He's been around since Mucheng started streaming.

51
00:03:20,100 --> 00:03:21,430
He must know something.

52
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:25,020
Otherwise, he wouldn't have turned from a loyal fan to a hater.

53
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:26,200
So now we can be considered

54
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,800
his allies on the same front.

55
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,930
He'll definitely reply if we message him.

56
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,660
He actually left me on read.

57
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:37,420
We are strangers.

58
00:03:37,420 --> 00:03:39,160
How could he easily trust us?

59
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:42,060
Just wait.

60
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:52,260
It's set.

61
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:52,790
Let's go.

62
00:04:00,700 --> 00:04:01,720
What do you want to eat?

63
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:02,450
I don't know.

64
00:04:04,460 --> 00:04:06,120
How did you get him to meet you?

65
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:09,420
I just pretended to be a streamer from the company

66
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:11,080
and lied to him that I was also a victim.

67
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:11,640
You...

68
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:13,260
Isn't that lying?

69
00:04:13,660 --> 00:04:14,260
So what?

70
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,360
This is called outsmarting.

71
00:04:18,339 --> 00:04:19,670
Boss, I'd like to order.

72
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:30,380
Boss, please add two more eggs for me.

73
00:04:30,460 --> 00:04:31,260
Okay.

74
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:34,620
What number are you picking up?

75
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:36,880
I am the defendant's lawyer, Gu Xingcan.

76
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,760
I deeply apologize for being late.

77
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,490
What number are you picking up?

78
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,530
Number nine.

79
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,140
Number nine has already been picked up.

80
00:04:50,140 --> 00:04:50,680
Is it him?

81
00:04:56,420 --> 00:04:57,220
Wait.

82
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,400
Should we chase him?

83
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,000
Of course.

84
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:03,280
What are you doing?

85
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:14,360
Don't come closer!

86
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,540
We just want to ask you something.

87
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:16,600
Don't come closer!

88
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,780
Don't come closer!

89
00:05:23,500 --> 00:05:24,120
Please.

90
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:25,100
Don't kill me.

91
00:05:25,620 --> 00:05:26,900
Please don't kill me.

92
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:28,860
Kill you?

93
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:30,980
I... I swear.

94
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:32,460
I've deleted everything.

95
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:33,400
Don't kill me.

96
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:35,100
Why is he so scared?

97
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:39,900
Just calm down.

98
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,659
We won't hurt you.

99
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:45,760
Just answer my questions.

100
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,960
Who wants to kill you?

101
00:05:51,620 --> 00:05:53,340
It's Lingze, right?

102
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,490
Don't be afraid.

103
00:06:06,860 --> 00:06:08,120
We are here to help you.

104
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,800
Lingze is my enemy too.

105
00:06:12,620 --> 00:06:13,660
That's why I came to find you.

106
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:15,260
Help me bring him to justice.

107
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,860
I don't know anything, really.

108
00:06:18,860 --> 00:06:20,520
I really don't know anything.

109
00:06:21,100 --> 00:06:22,820
I was just talking nonsense online.

110
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:24,220
Total nonsense, really.

111
00:06:24,260 --> 00:06:26,190
I... I really don't know anything.

112
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,659
No, you can't touch this.

113
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,300
Give it back to me.

114
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,080
Why do you have this notebook?

115
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:00,620
Say something.

116
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:02,840
Why is it with you?

117
00:07:03,140 --> 00:07:03,940
What's wrong?

118
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:06,820
This...

119
00:07:07,220 --> 00:07:09,000
This is my father's notebook.

120
00:07:12,740 --> 00:07:13,600
Your father?

121
00:07:22,420 --> 00:07:23,220
Sit.

122
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:35,760
You arranged things well yesterday.

123
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:38,150
Uncle Zhao is very satisfied with you.

124
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:44,200
Keep in touch with Uncle Zhao in the future.

125
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:47,060
This relationship is very important to us.

126
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:49,300
Yes, Father.

127
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:58,640
Are you serious about that girl from yesterday?

128
00:08:01,260 --> 00:08:01,740
Yes,

129
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:03,380
Father.

130
00:08:08,820 --> 00:08:09,960
I want to marry her.

131
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:12,550
Please give us your blessing, Father.

132
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,260
This lawyer,

133
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:17,820
how capable is she?

134
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,490
She is very capable.

135
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:22,620
She handled the female streamer's case.

136
00:08:23,220 --> 00:08:24,750
I also value her abilities.

137
00:08:25,460 --> 00:08:26,160
It seems

138
00:08:27,020 --> 00:08:28,640
she is very valuable to us.

139
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:31,960
Thank you, Father.

140
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,360
Go.

141
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:35,820
Goodbye, Father.

142
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,220
Five years ago,

143
00:08:46,900 --> 00:08:48,900
long before Mucheng became famous,

144
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,300
I already knew her.

145
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:55,360
After she was persecuted by Lingze,

146
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:58,260
she poured out her troubles to me.

147
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:01,460
I decided then

148
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:03,120
to do everything in my power

149
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:05,180
to help her escape Lingze's control.

150
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:07,500
So,

151
00:09:09,060 --> 00:09:11,120
I took the evidence Mucheng provided

152
00:09:12,460 --> 00:09:13,520
and found Uncle Gu.

153
00:09:15,100 --> 00:09:17,400
I hope Uncle Gu's abilities and resources

154
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:20,400
can help us expose the inside story of Lingze Company.

155
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:13,020
Uncle Gu's investigation

156
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:16,190
also revealed a bigger secret.

157
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,730
The real mastermind behind the scenes

158
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,340
is Ling Hengsheng.

159
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:24,280
Ling Hengsheng originally

160
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:26,540
started by running a microloan company.

161
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:30,000
He quickly made his fortune through certain means.

162
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,130
Although it is a legal enterprise now,

163
00:10:32,220 --> 00:10:34,060
to clear his name,

164
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:37,260
he used Lingshi Media Company

165
00:10:37,260 --> 00:10:40,700
as his backyard to maintain connections with the upper class.

166
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:42,360
Streamers like Mucheng

167
00:10:43,420 --> 00:10:45,200
are just tools in their hands,

168
00:10:45,460 --> 00:10:46,680
or even playthings.

169
00:10:50,420 --> 00:10:52,080
And Uncle Gu's investigation

170
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:54,550
ultimately brought him a fatal disaster.

171
00:10:59,660 --> 00:11:00,860
Don't come near me.

172
00:11:02,060 --> 00:11:02,860
Do it.

173
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:12,700
All of this...

174
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,330
All of this is entirely your fault.

175
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:17,620
If it weren't for helping you and Mucheng,

176
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:19,550
my father wouldn't have had to die.

177
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:20,820
Xingcan.
